VERIFIED: sum(E) = H*(n-1). E[a,:].sum() = H - #{HP ending at a}.

THE VERTEX INSERTION FORMULA:

  H(T+v) = H(T) + 2 * sum_{a: v->a, b: b->v} E[a,b]

  This computes H(T+v) from E and the signature of v in O(n^2).
  If E can be updated incrementally, total = O(n^3) per tournament.
